{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225510","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225510","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322551001:1":{"text":"こ、この罪人ども……どうして降霊の儀式の邪魔をする！偉大なる意志が黙ってないぞ！","source_cn":"你……你们这些罪人，居然敢阻止我们和灵魂沟通“降灵”！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79FB9140D06FF46D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322551002:1":{"text":"偉大なる意志よ！あなたの敬虔な信徒を傷つけた、この者たちを罰してください！","source_cn":"伟大意志啊！请求您降罪于这些伤害您忠诚信徒的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE32BB3151DACEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322551003:1":{"text":"話になりませんね……とりあえずこのまま連行しましょう。","source_cn":"看来和他们是无法正常沟通的……咱们还是把这些人押回去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5EDF8993E010AF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:顽固的邪教徒":{"text":"頑固な邪教徒","source":"顽固的邪教徒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}